    <dashboard name='Summary Tab'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/BPO/workbooks/APACSmartTicketAllocationDailyPartnerCare/SummaryTab?rev=' id='SummaryTab' path='/t/BPO/workbooks/APACSmartTicketAllocationDailyPartnerCare' revision='' site='BPO' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='850' maxwidth='1600' minheight='850' minwidth='1600' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98118' id='3' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99000' x='500' y='941'>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='39412' id='5' type-v2='text' w='99000' x='500' y='941'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontcolor='#e54ba3' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#e54ba3' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Foodpanda APAC</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#e54ba3' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='16'>Smart Ticket Allocation Dashboard</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>29th October 2020</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e54ba3' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>DESCRIPTION</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>The purpose of this dashboard is to review the QA audit adherence. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>To achieve this, every week maximum of 14 tickets for each agent will be selected and the selection criteria is purely based on the set rules and their weightage allocation.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>The adherence percentage will be calculated based on each agent. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>For any agent to be considered as adhered, atleast 6 ticekts has to be evaluated during the week from the provided ones(maximum of 14). </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>In case an agent has less then 6 tickets in the entire week then in that case all of the tickets will be provided and all of them have to be evaluated then the agent will be consideered as adhered. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>The final adherence percentage for a BPO will be number of agents adhered divided by total agents who have worked on atleast one ticket. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='871' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='870' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='39412' id='5' type-v2='text' w='99000' x='500' y='941'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#e54ba3' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='14'>---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#e54ba3' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>Foodpanda APAC</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#e54ba3' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='16'>Smart Ticket Allocation Dashboard</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>29th October 2020</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#e54ba3' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>DESCRIPTION</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>The purpose of this dashboard is to review the QA audit adherence. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>To achieve this, every week maximum of 14 tickets for each agent will be selected and the selection criteria is purely based on the set rules and their weightage allocation.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>The adherence percentage will be calculated based on each agent. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>For any agent to be considered as adhered, atleast 6 ticekts has to be evaluated during the week from the provided ones(maximum of 14). </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>In case an agent has less then 6 tickets in the entire week then in that case all of the tickets will be provided and all of them have to be evaluated then the agent will be consideered as adhered. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#353744' fontname='Proxima Nova,sans-serif' fontsize='12'>The final adherence percentage for a BPO will be number of agents adhered divided by total agents who have worked on atleast one ticket. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{77B0130C-059C-462F-ACDD-13D60340F7EF}' />
    </dashboard>
